# {{NAME}} — Vesting Wallet

A vesting contract that releases tokens linearly to a beneficiary after a cliff period.

## Parameters

| Parameter | Description |
|---|---|
| `NAME` | Contract display name |
| `SYMBOL` | Token symbol |
| `TOTAL_SUPPLY` | Total tokens to vest |
| `BENEFICIARY` | Beneficiary address |
| `CLIFF_BLOCKS` | Cliff in blocks before any release |
| `DURATION_BLOCKS` | Total vesting duration in blocks |

## How it works

- After `cliff_blocks` from deploy, tokens start vesting linearly.
- After `duration_blocks`, all tokens are fully vested.
- The beneficiary calls `release()` to claim available tokens.
- `releasable()` shows how much is currently available.

## Deploy

```bash
python -m vm_py.cli.compile --manifest manifest.json --out build/
python -m omni_sdk.cli.deploy --manifest manifest.json --rpc <RPC_URL>
```

## Simulate

```bash
python -m vm_py.cli.run --manifest manifest.json --call releasable
```
